      "traits": [
        "darkness",
        "light",
        "primal"
      ],
      "description": "<p>Umbral pixies exude shadow, counteracting all other light and darkness effects their level or lower to leave dim light out to 10 feet (counteract rank 4, counteract bonus +12). The shadow pixie can suppress this effect with a single action, which has the concentrate trait. While the effect is suppressed, the shadow pixie's Strikes don't deal cold damage and they can't use their shadow spark Strike.</p>",
